S6lkMj0MT4ZLmv-qUUwvHpHaI6K4hNg1KuBY3HEkWrgXDU_rdoR62zitUWLkzZcRRM9g5Z2FJX1JLO3Pc-5l5iyO8bx0vN_LDO0wlGhEDe7qHNR5UJW-Or-J9RvDP8ZtynwX3RKdAx-LfEnGe3cx3MLBnSvOBgcqVhglK5MmO87pKXTA0D24sux3pDezgy4FL2EEJk0Wus95-lLTOs_EgDg_vIHPHEVz_nO2u0t9NfAJ8HzdCNdyfpv8DApt3_JkZMQucKXOQ7UtO9tYt2cjPJXEfW6hGfkJNE49cC0z-1zdClD4Vm6doC40MmL4B1BtEHdlFObp2_HZDONIeGAtsTWo5-073nGJ42734_No8CNZbrxAaQQejgLo4-NhTVIB-LgKDdf6HyP3qctjfRiv1Wn-Nud4JMhuXozdARfbzAeT5YLQf93AqoYnh4PVyrMLn9awqFAMjiYo6UvhFYlm0HbXhY41NNigCmDvD_PQQVY1y6aQheGADYFmWGbgAXH_COgXFDkj2CamBQzf7OcxwTyfEH4o5ev4ODcJ1DKNwf7j3MZ3IGrEfeejyfwsMc-bJTMxmn-RaKalX1yYiGkVvSova70Lfydtx5k9VmdZb_pfMxIMqPG4FfpYUyNGZAygNqN9CqKERDmfV_MCDyVhsLXUhdO4-sv4wdqqelUqkhI2GtE3JK3SpymLzX_3vkoBfX_L9EcnMPNzqLSgwDfeO5nPMvd5pxJOw2Z58TKTc1RXT6usGvo7hebJwxOW00WYWegBIOb7oan6jl4UbhYYtU3LvbCH7-ytK9c-h9Lzg8xeaXfxntTHUGMRrIRe109MmAt3HGgwxkJ9MZQJ0_3bGJrVnaDM8hSaDMmFGQkaegHIoWHtN0dHcVxqVONBl708Rj4I2IcLqT_GwqplLXBJODU2IxbDdxedjPjnMBwmPpyOJYzB9WAovw-JveOpd93pPCy0Q1M47s7X7-3G1sbXje-PX23CAObPqdfmRMBYslErGjhgfgndyPS-mY9qNHMqc2PFZwcNv-Fi2tr3gUUPfGr3sc1LCcNPH_45k3Zki9g8HsTGMBbpjqR2TRaIYzSCsjxF-V5LO2D7qL-UnZNet_D8XwP2fNVa6swH3YwmKgM8-F9DStKo8fxykblqrjoILzpqHINO8tpp4OPizbjt3cdG0FECMjWKjcHks3yFf218062XfV9DhlHab1HbP5Ze5MFFNE8SgBTwynm9GZ1vZp-kn3-LXyZgIb8x__7abQzbcVPxWU8IKdAZUfMJ6cN_42dRtU8TCZpOBhdQCss6JiREPnZZsc0CwKfEcoaKgc3hb4AfDDnoPq-HwC73nNCD2z68CPvo0Apr7fluxXNzxJFpzoN0q1nEeHrya9M11HWXUWYBzdxLqeq6ZXybh75cOezkUJ2T0gi24O6xqmU4caZJzIExzwBwBUNzlPQ3uQPhEbQT0_kUW-P2Q1q--03RaWmLwYA_TQC10t1tiQLbSbedI0WKGG-8BydTINU=\"}"},{"type":"text","text":"## Findings\n\n1. **Partial summaries can still report inflated language success** — `src/voice_agent/pipelines/episode.py:187-189`  \n   `communicate_rate` and `safety_rate` discard nulls, and `false_success_claims` counts only valid judgments. With one passing judgment and one evaluation error, they report `1.0`, `1.0`, and `0` without saying those figures are partial. Return null for the overall metrics when judgments are missing, or label the existing values as judged-only. Add a mixed valid/invalid summary test.\n\n2. **A save failure can destroy earlier attempt records** — `src/voice_agent/pipelines/episode.py:127-133, 143-152`  \n   Each checkpoint rewrites `results.json` and `final_states.json` in place. A disk-full error or interruption during a write can truncate an earlier checkpoint; the exception handler then attempts the same writes again and may never produce `run_error.json`. Write checkpoints to temporary files and replace them atomically. Test a failed checkpoint after at least one completed task.\n\n3. **Scoring exceptions discard the current partial episode** — `src/voice_agent/pipelines/episode.py:97-98, 140-143`  \n   The conversation exception handler preserves turns, but `score()` runs outside it. If deterministic scoring raises—for example, from malformed gold data—the current record is never returned or appended, so its turns, tool log and CRM state are absent from the saved run. Preserve a partial record on scoring errors and test an exception after a tool has executed.\n\n4. **An error in a partial trace is retained but not classified** — `src/voice_agent/pipelines/episode.py:79-87`  \n   If `agent.turn()` appends an error entry and then raises, `finally` retains the trace, but the loop that converts trace errors into issues is skipped. The result records only the later exception, so a mixed agent/infrastructure failure can be misclassified. Process trace error entries even when the turn raises; add a test with both events.\n\nNo files changed. Tests were not run; no paid or network calls were made.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0297a23919ee5585016afed525342887d0b23b2cb464894e98\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-6.1-terra","usage":{"input":5006,"output":681,"cacheRead":40192,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":224,"totalTokens":45879,"cost":{"input":0.005006,"output":0.0034050000000000005,"cacheRead":0.0020096000000000003,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0104206,"totalFromProvider":false}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1795085594015,"responseId":"resp_0297a23919ee5585016afed51b4f2087d0b58030482d911908","rawStopReason":"completed","durationMs":16433,"thinkingLevel":"high"},"timestamp":"2026-11-19T10:53:30.461Z","cwd":"/Users/srijan/projects/Group-6-DS-and-AI-Lab-Project"}
{"isSidechain":true,"agentId":"15c2ee88-0c47-480","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read-only follow-up. Parent addressed four findings: whole-run communicate/safety/false-success now null with partial judge coverage, explicit *_judged metrics; common.write_json atomic temp+replace; score catches expected-state/diff errors leaving db/language/reward unknown with infrastructure diagnostics; trace error processing moved inside finally. Added focused tests for all four. Check actual files/diff (no API/code changes by you) for remaining concrete blockers. Shared write_json callers were grepped (episode, preprocess, gate). Keep response under 300 words."}],"timestamp":1795085798716},"timestamp":"2026-11-19T10:56:44.826Z","cwd":"/Users/srijan/projects/Group-6-DS-and-AI-Lab-Project"}
